  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(sqrt[3]{0.08×0.8× p}=0.008 × 0.8 × sqrt[3]{q})\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(sqrt[3]{a} = a¹/³) and basic algebraic rearrangement\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(sqrt[3]{0.08×0.8× p}=0.008 × 0.8 × sqrt[3]{q})\n\n(sqrt[3]{0.064 × p}=0.0064 × sqrt[3]{q})\n\n(sqrt[3]{0.064}×sqrt[3]{p}=0.0064 × sqrt[3]{q})\n\n(0.4×sqrt[3]{p}=0.0064 × sqrt[3]{q})\n\n(sqrt[3]{p}=0.016 × sqrt[3]{q})\n\n(sqrt[3]{p}/sqrt[3]{q}=0.016)\n\n⇒ (sqrt[3]{p/q}=0.016)\n\n⇒ (p/q=(0.016)³)\n\n⇒ (p/q=0.000004096)\n\n⇒ 84 × 10-9\n\n**∴ The value of 84 × 10-9.**\n\n60:Ta58,\n<",
